  'https://www.journal-ayurveda-integ-med.com/', 'https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-ayurveda-and-integrative-medicine'),
  'https://www.journal-ayurveda-integ-med.com', 'https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-ayurveda-and-integrative-medicine'),
  'http://www.journal-ayurveda-integ-med.com', 'https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-ayurveda-and-integrative-medicine')
